('sofer-inchiriere','en','60','060','To take the exam to obtain the certificate of professional competence for transport for rent, the driver must present:','[{"key":"a","text":"certified copy of the taxi authorization"},{"key":"b","text":"driving license category B"},{"key":"c","text":"proof of completion of a professional training course for practicing for-hire transport"},{"key":"d","text":"taxi authorization"}]','c','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','61','061','Vehicles used to carry out transport for rent must be owned by the authorized carrier:','[{"key":"a","text":"by title (deed) of property"},{"key":"b","text":"by title (deed) of property or leasing contract"},{"key":"c","text":"by title (deed) of property or leasing contract or commodate contract"},{"key":"d","text":"by title (deed) of property or with a rental contract"}]','b','[]'),
