('sofer-inchiriere','en','85','085','What are the risks of continuously keeping your foot on the clutch pedal?','[{"key":"a","text":"clutch overheating"},{"key":"b","text":"differential lock"},{"key":"c","text":"loss of tire-road adhesion"},{"key":"d","text":"service brake overheating"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','86','086','The effectiveness of anti-lock braking systems is greater:','[{"key":"a","text":"on roads with concrete pavement"},{"key":"b","text":"on roads with high grip"},{"key":"c","text":"on roads with low grip"},{"key":"d","text":"on roads with steep slopes"}]','c','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','87','087','The ABS system allows:','[{"key":"a","text":"avoiding wheel locking and increasing braking efficiency"},{"key":"b","text":"differential lock to prevent the wheel with less grip from spinning"},{"key":"c","text":"increasing tire-road adhesion when braking"},{"key":"d","text":"wheel locking in case of emergency braking"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','88','088','ABS anti-lock braking systems intervene on:','[{"key":"a","text":"differential"},{"key":"b","text":"fuel feed system of the engine"},{"key":"c","text":"service braking system"},{"key":"d","text":"steering systems"}]','c','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','89','089','If the ABS warning light comes on while driving during sudden braking:','[{"key":"a","text":"nothing will happen"},{"key":"b","text":"only the wheel where the sensor failed will lock"},{"key":"c","text":"the vehicle will skid"},{"key":"d","text":"the wheels will slip"}]','d','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','90','090','The ASR system is designed for:','[{"key":"a","text":"avoiding wheel locking when braking"},{"key":"b","text":"braking the drive wheels by blocking the exhaust manifold"},{"key":"c","text":"ensuring braking on long slopes"},{"key":"d","text":"preventing the tire from breaking grip on the ground when starting from a standstill"}]','d','[]'),
