('sofer-inchiriere','en','102','102','An incorrect driving position may lead to:','[{"key":"a","text":"decreased resistance to fatigue"},{"key":"b","text":"erroneous perception of distances"},{"key":"c","text":"incorrect use of the travel lane"},{"key":"d","text":"the lack of correlation between driving speed and visibility"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','103','103','An incorrect driving position may lead to:','[{"key":"a","text":"decrease in anticipation time"},{"key":"b","text":"decrease in reaction time"},{"key":"c","text":"decreased concentration"},{"key":"d","text":"decreasing the time to observe potential hazards"}]','c','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','104','104','Lighting a cigarette while driving:','[{"key":"a","text":"all of the above options"},{"key":"b","text":"is an action that helps increase concentration"},{"key":"c","text":"leads to non-reception of some information and an accident may occur"},{"key":"d","text":"leads to the removal of the feeling of fatigue"}]','c','[]'),
