('sofer-inchiriere','en','106','106','While driving, fatigue may have the following effects:','[{"key":"a","text":"alcohol consumption"},{"key":"b","text":"decrease in reaction time"},{"key":"c","text":"increasing anticipation capabilities"},{"key":"d","text":"taking additional risks to shorten the journey time"}]','d','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','107','107','Improper operation of which of the following controls can increase the vehicle''s roll motion (the vehicle''s tilt oscillations around its longitudinal axis)?','[{"key":"a","text":"acceleration"},{"key":"b","text":"clutch"},{"key":"c","text":"gear shifter"},{"key":"d","text":"steering wheel"}]','d','[]'),
