('sofer-inchiriere','en','136','136','Which of the listed materials, which are part of the minimum equipment of motor vehicles, have limited and specified shelf lives, which entails the obligation of their periodic replacement or renewal?','[{"key":"a","text":"fire extinguisher"},{"key":"b","text":"key kit"},{"key":"c","text":"reflective triangles"},{"key":"d","text":"spare wheel"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','137','137','How to check the operation of the vehicle''s service brake?','[{"key":"a","text":"by attempts to start from a standstill with the parking brake applied"},{"key":"b","text":"by controlling the air pressure in the braking system"},{"key":"c","text":"exclusively by controlling the pressure resistance and the brake pedal travel"},{"key":"d","text":"through controlled attempts to start from a standstill and stop the vehicle with the service brake"}]','d','[]'),
