('sofer-inchiriere','en','139','139','The operations to prepare the vehicle for the journey include:','[{"key":"a","text":"checking the condition of the tires and periodically restoring tire pressures"},{"key":"b","text":"performing engine and transmission oil changes"},{"key":"c","text":"replacement of lubricant and fuel filters"},{"key":"d","text":"replacing door and hatch seals"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','140','140','The operations to prepare the vehicle for the journey include:','[{"key":"a","text":"changing the coolant in the cooling system"},{"key":"b","text":"checking and cleaning mirrors, glass surfaces and windshield wipers"},{"key":"c","text":"performing engine and transmission oil changes"},{"key":"d","text":"replacement of lubricant and fuel filters"}]','b','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','141','141','What is the estimated total duration of vehicle preparation operations carried out by the driver before leaving on a journey?','[{"key":"a","text":"about 1 day"},{"key":"b","text":"about 1-2 hours"},{"key":"c","text":"about 20-30 minutes"},{"key":"d","text":"about 5 minutes"}]','c','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','142','142','In risky situations characteristic of cornering, skidding may be avoided by:','[{"key":"a","text":"avoiding the use of the service brake"},{"key":"b","text":"differential lock and clutch release"},{"key":"c","text":"energetic application of the service brake"},{"key":"d","text":"simultaneous clutch release with heavy braking"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','143','143','In risky situations characteristic of cornering, skidding may be avoided by:','[{"key":"a","text":"all-wheel drive disengagement"},{"key":"b","text":"intermittent and pendulum steering"},{"key":"c","text":"shifting to a higher gear in the gearbox"},{"key":"d","text":"smooth steering wheel operation – operated continuously, without interruptions"}]','d','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','144','144','As a driver who carries out passenger transport for rent, your main responsibility is:','[{"key":"a","text":"applying the specific signs for the transport of passengers in taxi mode on the vehicle body"},{"key":"b","text":"collecting the value of the transport carried out according to the indications of the taximeter device"},{"key":"c","text":"issuing tax receipts to customers"},{"key":"d","text":"passenger safety and comfort"}]','d','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','145','145','The main reason why a driver carring passengers for rent must avoid sudden braking is:','[{"key":"a","text":"passenger safety and comfort"},{"key":"b","text":"reducing brake wear"},{"key":"c","text":"reducing maintenance and repair costs"},{"key":"d","text":"reducing tire wear"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','146','146','The speed of travel at night must be chosen so that:','[{"key":"a","text":"allow the vehicle to stop within a maximum of 10m"},{"key":"b","text":"the dipped headlights should not disturb those driving in the opposite direction"},{"key":"c","text":"to allow the vehicle to stop as quickly as possible"},{"key":"d","text":"to allow the vehicle to stop within the field of vision"}]','d','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','147','147','How will be a driver punished if leaves the scene of an accident where a person was injured?','[{"key":"a","text":"with a criminal fine"},{"key":"b","text":"with imprisonment and cancellation of driving license"},{"key":"c","text":"with imprisonment and suspension of driving license"},{"key":"d","text":"withholding the driving license and applying penalty points"}]','b','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','148','148','When overtaking, signaling with flashing lights is done:','[{"key":"a","text":"from the beginning of the maneuver to its end"},{"key":"b","text":"from the beginning of the maneuver until its end only in places with reduced visibility"},{"key":"c","text":"only to signal the intention to overtake and the engagement in overtaking"},{"key":"d","text":"only to signal the intention to overtake, the engagement in overtaking and the actual overtaking-overtaking"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','149','149','In which of the following places is the U-turn maneuver of a car prohibited?','[{"key":"a","text":"in places where the solidity of the roads does not allow"},{"key":"b","text":"less than 50 meters from public transport stations"},{"key":"c","text":"on national roads"},{"key":"d","text":"on public roads with steep slopes, signalized as such"}]','a','[]'),
