('sofer-inchiriere','en','151','151','What do you do at night when another vehicle is approaching from the opposite direction?','[{"key":"a","text":"drive as far to the right of the road as possible at low speed with your parking lights on"},{"key":"b","text":"Drive carefully, leaving your parking lights on so as not to blind the driver approaching from the opposite direction"},{"key":"c","text":"reduce speed and turn on your low beams"},{"key":"d","text":"turn on your parking lights and follow the lane markings"}]','a','[]'),
