('sofer-inchiriere','en','154','154','When passing through undirected cross-roads within a city/village, the speed must be:','[{"key":"a","text":"30 km/h"},{"key":"b","text":"40 km/h"},{"key":"c","text":"50 km/h"},{"key":"d","text":"as there is no regulated speed limit, it must be reduced to the limit necessary to avoid any danger"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','155','155','If visibility is reduced below 100 m in conditions of fog, heavy rain, heavy snowfall, the traffic speed in cities/villages must be:','[{"key":"a","text":"30 km/h"},{"key":"b","text":"40 km/h"},{"key":"c","text":"50 km/h"},{"key":"d","text":"as there is no regulated speed limit, it must be reduced to the limit necessary to avoid any danger"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','156','156','If visibility is reduced below 100 m in conditions of fog, heavy rain, heavy snowfall, the speed of traffic outside cities/villages must be:','[{"key":"a","text":"30 km/h"},{"key":"b","text":"40 km/h"},{"key":"c","text":"50 km/h"},{"key":"d","text":"as there is no regulated speed limit, it must be reduced to the limit necessary to avoid any danger"}]','c','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','157','157','The order of intervention for providing first aid to a person who has suffered multiple injuries is:','[{"key":"a","text":"clearing the airway, stopping bleeding, immobilizing fractures"},{"key":"b","text":"immobilizing fractures, clearing the airway and stopping bleeding"},{"key":"c","text":"it doesn''t matter"},{"key":"d","text":"stopping bleeding, clearing the airway and immobilizing fractures"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','158','158','Entering the highway, from a side road through a road junction, is done on the lane:','[{"key":"a","text":"acceleration, increasing speed before entering the current traffic flow"},{"key":"b","text":"acceleration, reducing speed to avoid possible collisions"},{"key":"c","text":"intended for emergency parking"},{"key":"d","text":"intended for slow vehicles"}]','a','[]'),
