('sofer-inchiriere','en','164','164','If the employee commits a disciplinary offense, the employer is prohibited from applying to him/her:','[{"key":"a","text":"demotion from office"},{"key":"b","text":"disciplinary fines"},{"key":"c","text":"disciplinary termination of the individual labour contract"},{"key":"d","text":"the written warning"}]','b','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','165','165','The individual labour contract is concluded:','[{"key":"a","text":"based on the consent of the parties, in verbal form, in the mother tongue"},{"key":"b","text":"based on the consent of the parties, in writing, in Romanian"},{"key":"c","text":"based on the employer''s consent in verbal form, in Romanian"},{"key":"d","text":"with the consent of the employee only, in writing, in the native language"}]','b','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','166','166','What is the normal period of working time per day:','[{"key":"a","text":"10 hours"},{"key":"b","text":"12 hours"},{"key":"c","text":"6 hours"},{"key":"d","text":"8 hours"}]','d','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','167','167','Is driving at a too low speed dangerous for the traffic?','[{"key":"a","text":"not"},{"key":"b","text":"only on steep slopes"},{"key":"c","text":"yes, because it forces other drivers to change lanes, or engage in risky overtaking"},{"key":"d","text":"yes, only on a one-way road"}]','c','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','168','168','Skill in driving vehicles on public roads is a component of:','[{"key":"a","text":"curriculum"},{"key":"b","text":"preventive conduct"},{"key":"c","text":"promptness and attention"},{"key":"d","text":"theoretical, practical and pedagogical knowledge"}]','b','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','169','169','The duration between the moment an obstacle is observed and the moment the brake is applied, called reaction time, is usually evaluated at:','[{"key":"a","text":"1 second"},{"key":"b","text":"2 seconds"},{"key":"c","text":"3 seconds"},{"key":"d","text":"5 seconds"}]','a','[]'),
