('sofer-inchiriere','en','172','172','What is the part of the road on your itinerary that you need to drive carefully on?','[{"key":"a","text":"the entire itinerary"},{"key":"b","text":"the part that crosses mountain areas, with serpentines"},{"key":"c","text":"the section with heavy traffic"},{"key":"d","text":"urban traffic part"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','173','173','As a precaution, before setting off on a journey, the driver must not neglect checks regarding:','[{"key":"a","text":"fluid level"},{"key":"b","text":"lights, levels, signaling, wheels and brakes"},{"key":"c","text":"signaling and brakes"},{"key":"d","text":"the existence of an identity card on board"}]','b','[]'),
