('sofer-inchiriere','en','175','175','Judgment is one of the component elements of:','[{"key":"a","text":"driving within the legal limits allowed"},{"key":"b","text":"preventive driving"},{"key":"c","text":"theoretical and practical knowledge"},{"key":"d","text":"vigilant driving"}]','b','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','176','176','Promptness, speed, selectivity and accuracy are important attributes of:','[{"key":"a","text":"alertness"},{"key":"b","text":"judgment"},{"key":"c","text":"leadership skills"},{"key":"d","text":"skills"}]','b','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','177','177','Driving defensively means:','[{"key":"a","text":"to anticipate situations that could become dangerous"},{"key":"b","text":"to drive at a constant speed"},{"key":"c","text":"to respect traffic rules on public roads"},{"key":"d","text":"to warn other road users about mistakes made"}]','a','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','178','178','Aquaplaning, the loss of contact between the tire and the road surface, occurs on a road:','[{"key":"a","text":"with a layer of water or melted snow"},{"key":"b","text":"with a pronounced slope"},{"key":"c","text":"with an irregular geometry"},{"key":"d","text":"with pronounced unevenness"}]','a','[]'),
