('sofer-inchiriere','en','180','180','The phenomenon of aquaplaning generates the following hazards:','[{"key":"a","text":"increasing tire-to-ground adhesion"},{"key":"b","text":"loss of steering and braking control"},{"key":"c","text":"reduction in engine capacity"},{"key":"d","text":"splashing water on the windshield"}]','b','[]'),
