('sofer-inchiriere','en','182','182','By driving too close to the vehicle in front, a driver joins the ranks of those who:','[{"key":"a","text":"drive preventively and have an increased reaction time"},{"key":"b","text":"I drive relaxed, without stress because I show foresight and anticipation"},{"key":"c","text":"is based on a wealth of leadership experience"},{"key":"d","text":"take risks and arrive at their destination very tired"}]','d','[]'),
('sofer-inchiriere','en','183','183','Correct adjustment of the driver''s seat, rearview mirrors and seat belts are:','[{"key":"a","text":"mandatory rules, punishable by a misdemeanor"},{"key":"b","text":"measures taken in accordance with preventive conduct"},{"key":"c","text":"recommendations of the road authority"},{"key":"d","text":"recommendations to be made to the public administrator"}]','b','[]'),
